        <mxCell id="c139" value="&lt;i&gt;Columns B to H (OrderDate to ApproverTerminationDate) are hidden. 14 orders score 1 or more: 11 score 2, then 3 score 1, in the order of the Table. Outlined: the two note-financed capital purchases of Exercise 8.2, PO-2024-001942 and PO-2026-011104. Each Disposition starts with Follow up and continues beyond the row; the classification is provisional until the policy, the configuration and the access logs are seen.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="624" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
